00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:05,200
她说"你给我买新鞋我就给你钥匙"
She said, "I'll give you the key if you buy me new shoes."

172
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:08,580
是为了爱情
For love!

173
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:10,800
我是为了爱情啊
I did it for love!

174
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:13,860
你们俩应该在一起
You two belong together.

175
00:08:13,860 --> 00:08:14,840
就像我跟小鞋鞋一样
Like me and these shoes.

176
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,840
别这样 求你给我一次机会
Come on, just give me a chance to express

177
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:19,340
告诉你我内心深处的感受
my deep feelings about this.

178
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:22,240
麦克斯 我想说...
Max, what I'm trying to say is...

179
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,520
我不想当你的朋友
I don't wanna be your friend.

180
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,660
我想当你的男朋友
I wanna be your boyfriend.

181
00:08:28,500 --> 00:08:30,480
你现在看起来像要当我的女朋友
Well, right now it looks like you want to be my girlfriend.

182
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,220
我给你指点迷津一下吧
Maybe I can help clear things up.

183
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:35,600
这又得花我多少银子
How much is this gonna cost me?

184
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:37,920
分文不收好吗
Nothing. Look...

185
00:08:38,540 --> 00:08:40,520
麦克斯觉得自己不应该拥有个有钱人
Max doesn't think she deserves someone rich

186
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,700
因为她...
because she has...

187
00:08:41,860 --> 00:08:44,540
-自尊心超低 -错了
- Well, low self-esteem. - Wrong.

188
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:45,700
姐没有自尊
I have no self-esteem.

189
00:08:48,140 --> 00:08:50,100
还有 我现在能看到你的蛋蛋底
And I can see the bottom of your balls.

190
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,280
麦克斯 还记得两天前
Max, remember two days ago

191
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:57,000
你曾是个爱我蛋蛋底的姑娘吗
when you loved the bottom of my balls?

192
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:01,380
那时候以为它们很穷 我心疼它们
That's when they were poor and I felt sorry for them.

193
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,720
何苦呢 你们是天生一对
Come on, you two belong together.

194
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:08,400
像是蛋蛋笑话界里的罗密欧与朱丽叶
You're like the Romeo and Juliet of ball banter.

195
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:10,760
抱歉 但这就是不行
I'm sorry, it's just never gonna work.

196
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:13,140
我们就像是两个不同宗教家庭长大的 像...
It's like we were raised with different religions, like...

197
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:14,500
宗教有哪些啊
What are two religions?

198
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,120
你是想要观众给点意见呢
Are you taking suggestions from the audience,

199
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,140
还是你真不知道两个任意宗教的名字
or do you really not know the names of two religions?

200
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:24,540
比如说
Let's say...

201
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:26,120
一个女巫与一个蓝精灵
a witch and a smurf.

202
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:28,880
你的问题有答案了
Question answered.

203
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:33,120
比如我是个女巫 而你是个蓝精灵
So it's like I'm a witch and you're a smurf.

204
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:35,240
大家都知道我们是不可能在一起的
We could never be together. Everybody knows that.

205
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,800
我一辈子都当个女巫 没当过蓝精灵
I've only lived like a witch. I've never lived like a smurf.

206
00:09:37,860 --> 00:09:38,660
所以我完全不懂你
So I don't get you.

207
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:40,300
又蓝又软弱是什么感觉啊
What's it like being blue and soft?

208
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:41,620
我不知道 我是个女巫 我又绿又强大
I don't know, I'm a witch. I'm green and all-powerful.

209
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:45,940
所以你是说 咱俩不是同一个世界的人
So you're saying you can't relate to me

210
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:47,180
因为你从没当过蓝精灵吗
because you've never been a smurf?

211
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,680
哇 五雷轰顶啊
Wow. That's heavy.

212
00:09:50,340 --> 00:09:51,540
好吧 我该走了
Well, I'm gonna go.

213
00:09:51,540 --> 00:09:54,920
我最好脱下这傻袍子 换回我的短裙再走
Oh, I better take off this silly robe and put on my skirt.

214
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:59,320
她也得把鞋子还回去
And she's giving back the shoes.

215
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:02,080
别想 她才不会还
Oh, no, she is not!

216
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:12,100
"语种选择
"Language preference:

217
00:10:12,180 --> 00:10:14,000
英语 西班牙语 中文 法语"
English, Spanish, Chinese, French."

218
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:16,300
这玩意应该根据餐厅人群来定制语种
They should've made this more specific to the diner.

219
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,520
"嬉皮士 流浪汉 瘾君子 少女孕妇"
"Hipster, hobo, junkie, pregnant teen."

220
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:21,900
别忘了还有"撞伤头的芭蕾舞女"
Don't forget "Ballerina with a head wound."

221
00:10:23,660 --> 00:10:25,660
"您是否要查看账户余额"
"Would you like to see your account balance?"

222
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,740
那台提款机就是一贱人
That ATM's a real bitch.

223
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:32,200
我有个17岁的辣妹[17块钱] 想[取]出来
Yeah, I got a hot 17 in here that's dying to get out.

224
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:34,580
之前奥列格也这么说 后来被警察拦了下来
So did Oleg when that cop pulled him over.

225
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,160
卡洛琳 瞧瞧这收据
Caroline, look at this receipt.

226
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,020
肯定是出错了
This can't be right.

227
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:40,920
上次同事见到这么多零
I haven't seen this many zeros in one place

228
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,300
还是在餐厅的圣诞派对上呢
since the diner Christmas party.

229
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:45,320
上面显示你有100万零17块
That says $1,000,017.

230
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:48,060
阿憨 你的提款机坏了
Han, your ATM's broken.

231
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,320
它刚让麦克斯的账户多了100万
It just gave Max $1 million.

232
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:52,280
闪开 闪开 闪开
Out of my way! Out of my way! Out of my way!

233
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:59,380
我终于等到了 提款机出错乱给人钱
This is it--the faulty ATM that gives out millions.

234
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:02,540
我以为这跟尖锐湿疣一样 只是坊间传闻而已
I thought it was an urban legend like HPV.

235
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:06,220
大家别动
Everybody freeze.

236
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:08,120
那破玩意肯定是坏掉了
The damn thing must be busted.

237
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:10,660
为了搞这台提款机 我腰都要累弯了
And to think I bent over backwards to get that ATM.

238
00:11:11,251 --> 00:11:14,837
我也曾为了西语能得B "弯下腰"求老师
Well, I bent over forwards to get a "B" in Spanish.

239
00:11:16,418 --> 00:11:18,960
靠 我的账户还跟以前一样
Damn it. My account's exactly the same.

240
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,560
冻结中
Frozen.

241
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:24,180
对了 迪克之前有留张条给你
So, Deke left this note for you earlier.

242
00:11:24,420 --> 00:11:26,140
我都120岁了 能想起来就不错了
I forgot 'cause I'm 120.

243
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:32,300
现在你知道当蓝精灵是什么感觉了
Now you know what it's like to be a smurf.

244
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:36,180
说出来都没人信 那100万是迪克给我的
Can you believe this? Deke gave me $1 million!

245
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,900
所以那是真的钱吗
So that's real money?

246
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,100
那钱是真的吗
The money's real?

247
00:11:51,220 --> 00:11:52,520
你有100万
You have $1 million?

248
00:11:54,180 --> 00:11:55,400
我们成了百万富翁了
We're a millionaire?

249
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:06,180
早上好 我的朋友
Oh, good morning, my good man.

250
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:08,400
我最近突然得到一笔钱
I recently came into some money,

251
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,180
所以给自己买了个糖果皇冠
thus the candy tiara.

252
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,600
我想跟大家分享我的财富
And I wanted to spread the wealth.

253
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,240
给
Here.

254
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:15,680
这罐咖啡送你
Have a pound of coffee.

255
00:12:16,180 --> 00:12:18,760
福爵牌的哦 因为我现在是百万富翁啦
It's Folgers, since I'm a millionaire now.

256
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:22,060
这是"一觉醒来变有钱人"最爽的部分
Best part of waking up rich!

257
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:27,420
我为所有的好朋友们都准备了礼物
I come bearing gifts for all my best friends.

258
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:30,357
站在我身后的男人 给
Here, guy who stands behind me...

259
00:12:30,357 --> 00:12:34,700
给你一盒12节的7号电池
A 12-pack of triple-a batteries for you.

260
00:12:34,700 --> 00:12:37,940
没错 便利店的人专门为我打开玻璃橱
And yes, they did have to open the glass case at CVS

261
00:12:37,940 --> 00:12:38,920
我才能拿来送你
for me to get these.

262
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,700
站在我旁边的女人 给
Here, lady on the other side.

263
00:12:42,980 --> 00:12:45,700
洗发水和护发素
A shampoo and conditioner!

264
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,840
伊卡璐的 不值几个钱啦
Herbal Essences, no big deal.

265
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:52,640
我不会忘了你那份的 怪发妹
And don't think I forgot about you, peek-a-boo hair.

266
00:12:55,020 --> 00:12:57,100
送你一盒高迪瓦的巧克力
A Godiva box of chocolates.

267
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,900
你不是在做梦 这真的是高级巧克力哟
No, you're not dreaming. I said "Godiva"!

268
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:04,000
麦克斯 我有个好消息
Max, I have great news.

269
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:06,620
还有你 为了一双鞋子出卖我的女人
And you, woman who sold me out for shoes.

270
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:09,020
我出去扫货的时候
I got you something very special

271
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:10,140
为你挑了一份特别的礼物
when I was out gift shopping.

272
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:11,940
你还记得你经常说
You know how you always say,

273
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:14,300
"我要跟哪个学员搞 才能搞到一个食品封口夹"
"Who do I have to bang to get a chip clip around here?"

274
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:15,300
答案就是我
Me!

275
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,000
什么 你花那笔钱了吗
Wait, you spent money?

276
00:13:19,260 --> 00:13:21,320
我们那100万 你花了多少
How much of our million did you spend on your...

277
00:13:21,540 --> 00:13:22,980
在你这次"疯狂购物"上
we'll call it a shopping spree.

278
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:25,760
差不多全花掉了
Almost all of it.

279
00:13:29,540 --> 00:13:31,900
看来公立学校连花钱都没教好
Okay, our public schools have failed you.

280
00:13:32,220 --> 00:13:33,880
但你没去上过 它们想没教好你都没机会
Or they would have if you'd went.

281
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,880
但我现在太兴奋 顾不上这个了
But I'm too excited to care.

282
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,040
先说重要的 我们什么时候辞掉餐厅的工作
First things first. When do we quit the diner?

283
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:41,180
你在瞎说什么 我们才不会辞职
What are you talking about? We're not quitting the diner.

284
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,620
我要把剩下的钱还给他
I'm giving the rest of the money back.

285
00:13:43,180 --> 00:13:44,920
等下等下 这念头就此打住
Hold on, hold on, pump the brakes.

286
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:48,240
有什么问题吗 你已经得到你想要的封口夹了
What's the problem? You got a chip clip--you're set.

287
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,420
我花钱是为了向迪克表明我的态度
I only spent it to make a point to Deke.

288
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:53,840
你不能还回去 我已经计划好了 大计划
You can't give it back. I have plans. Big plans.

289
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,060
我们先辞掉餐厅的工作
After we quit the diner,

290
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:57,700
然后我认识个人 他可以把这小100万翻三倍
I found a guy who can turn that measly million into 3.

291
00:13:58,220 --> 00:13:59,720
别担心 他的名字不在
And don't worry, he was not named

292
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,000
我爸庞氏骗局的涉案人员名单中
in my father's Ponzi Scheme.

293
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:02,800
至少他现在这个假名不在
Well, not by the name he goes by now.

294
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,760
你好啊 蓝妹妹
What up, smurfette?

295
00:14:07,020 --> 00:14:08,320
你好 迪克
Oh, hello, Deke.

296
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:10,060
你刚错过了我用你这100万
You just missed me passing out

297
00:14:10,060 --> 00:14:11,700
给大家发礼物的豪气场面
all the gifts I bought with your million,

298
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:12,960
但你正好及时赶到 可以见证
But you're here in time to see me

299
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,720
我收买大玛丽当我搭档这一刻
buy Big Mary as my lab partner.

300
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,340
抱歉 我是非卖品
Who says I'm for sale?

301
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:20,060
猛男消防员日历
A fireman's calendar...

302
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:23,120
再加壮汉消防员日历
and another fireman's calendar.

303
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:26,023
成交
Sold.

304
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:31,080
我猜你肯定没想到我会花这笔钱吧
I bet you didn't think I'd spend that money, hmm?

305
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:33,460
那你就大错特错了
Well, you were wrong.

306
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:36,160
我花了整整143块
I spent $143!

307
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:39,740
麦克斯 我就是想让你花这笔钱
Max, I wanted you to spend the money

308
00:14:39,740 --> 00:14:41,200
好让你知道当有钱人是什么感觉
so you know what it's like to be rich.

309
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:42,520
现在我们都是蓝精灵了
Now we're both smurfs.

310
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:43,860
我们有是同一世界的人了
You can relate to me again.

311
00:14:44,460 --> 00:14:46,280
想像上周二那样 去烤箱那
Wanna go do hand stuff by the ovens

312
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,640
干点"手工活"吗
like we did last Tuesday?

313
00:14:49,780 --> 00:14:52,260
所以你是想用这笔钱收买我吗
Oh, so you were just trying to buy me with the money?

314
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:55,180
我不是那种高价的应招女郎
Well, I'm not a high-priced call girl.

315
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:56,960
因为超级碗的欢乐周末已经结束了
'cause Super Bowl weekend's over.

316
00:14:58,340 --> 00:15:00,340
给 剩下的钱还给你
Here. I'm giving you the rest of the money back.

317
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:01,840
别冲动
Okay...

318
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:04,360
她现在精神状态明显不能够
Obviously, she is not mentally competent enough

319
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,640
正确地处理她的财务
to handle her finances.

320
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:07,120
就像当时我奶奶
This is like when my grandma

321
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,840
想把她所有的钱都捐给一个孤儿院
wanted to give all her money to that orphanage,

322
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,480
所以我们不得不对外说她有老年痴呆症
so they had her diagnosed with Alzheimer's.

323
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,320
还你
Here.

324
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:15,140
真不敢相信我会有一个
I can't believe I'm losing all of my money

325
00:15:15,140 --> 00:15:16,480
两次失去所有钱的人生
twice in one lifetime.

326
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:18,880
谁有哮喘吸入器
who has an inhaler?

327
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:24,099
注意看 我还把你的名字写上了
And check it. I even put your name on there.

328
00:15:24,099 --> 00:15:28,001
"超级有钱一辈子无需为五斗米折腰的迪克"
"Deke Mc-Richy Mc-Never-Had-Yo-Work-For-Anything"?

329
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,858
抱歉 我还应该写上
Oh, sorry, I probably should've added,

330
00:15:29,858 --> 00:15:32,716
"爱装穷人的有钱佬"
"Richy Rich Pretended-He-Was-Poor-instein"

331
00:15:32,760 --> 00:15:33,920
好让人们知道那是你
So they'd know it's you.

332
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,300
来 我改一下
Here, I'll fix it.

333
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:39,580
没错 我也赏了自己好东西
Oh, yes. I treat myself well.

334
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,860
麦克斯 别闹了
You know what, Max? Stop.

335
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,540
我竭尽全力向你证明
I've tried everything to show you

336
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:45,900
我不是卡通里的那种土大款
I'm not some cartoon rich guy,

337
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:47,160
可你还是认为我是个笑话
and you still think I'm a joke.

338
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:49,380
你眼里只看到了我有钱 但我不止如此
You only see me as my money, but I'm not.

339
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:52,180
这就是金钱对我的意义
That's how much money means to me.

340
00:15:52,220 --> 00:15:53,160
但你说得对
But you were right.

341
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:54,940
咱俩的确不合适
It's not gonna work with us.

342
00:16:03,700 --> 00:16:06,600
麦克斯 我收到你的礼物了
Max. Oh, I got your gift.

343
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:09,080
我超爱我新的电动棒
I love my new vibrator.

344
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,300
那不是电动棒 苏菲
It's not a vibrator, Sophie.

345
00:16:14,300 --> 00:16:16,826
那是吸尘器
It's a Dustbuster.

346
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:21,060
好吧 现在我"那里"也一尘不染了
Well, there's no dust there anymore.

347
00:16:22,208 --> 00:16:25,124
我去我卡座坐着啊
I'll be in my booth.

348
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:27,460
小二 小二
Waitress. Waitress.

349
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,640
"小二" 她在喊谁呢
"Waitress"? Who's she talking to?

350
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:32,700
小姐
Miss...

351
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:34,240
我的三文鱼吃起来像鸡肉
This salmon tastes like chicken.

352
00:16:34,580 --> 00:16:35,980
那就奇怪了 因为那是猪肉做的
That's weird, 'cause it's pork.

353
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:39,540
就个小二跟我耍什么脾气
I don't need attitude from some waitress.

354
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:42,700
你一直喊的小二到底是谁啊
Who is this waitress you keep referring to?

355
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:46,420
你的工作是帮我点餐
Your job is to take my order,

356
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:48,640
对我笑脸相向 然后好好服务我
put a smile on your face, and serve me.

357
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:51,460
当然不是
Oh, hell, no!

358
00:16:54,060 --> 00:16:55,860
老娘才不用受你的气
I don't have to take this.

359
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:57,440
我给你看样东西 肥婆
Let me show you something, doll.

360
00:16:59,340 --> 00:17:02,700
这是我上次用提款机时打的余额单
This is my receipt from the last time I used the ATM.

361
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:05,080
你看见最后一行的"账户余额"有多少吗
You see where it says "Account balance" at the bottom there?

362
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,260
麻烦念给我听 谢谢
Read that number to me, please.

363
00:17:07,080 --> 00:17:09,640
如果你有100万 你干嘛还在这里工作
If you have $1 million, why would you be working here?

364
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:11,980
问得好
Good question.

365
00:17:15,980 --> 00:17:18,620
你好像很暴躁 要用我的吸尘器治疗"积怨"吗
You seem cranky. You want to use my Dustbuster?

366
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:25,260
那女人刚才问我
That woman just asked me

367
00:17:25,260 --> 00:17:28,180
如果我有100万 我干嘛还在这里工作
if I have $1 million, why am I working here?

368
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,580
我之前不就说了嘛
That's what I've been saying.

369
00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:31,420
我是说 我有100万耶
I mean, I have $1 million.

370
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:33,580
我之前不就说了嘛
That's what I've been saying.

371
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,240
老娘不用在这垃圾地方上班
I don't need to be in this dump!

372
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:37,420
重申一遍 我之前不就...
Again, that's what I've--

373
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:38,860
你是说了 我知道 我是个白痴
You've been saying! I know, I'm an idiot!

374
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:40,300
钱我决定不还给他了
I'm keeping that money!

375
00:17:40,380 --> 00:17:41,735
我之前不就说了嘛 不能还啊
That's what I've been saying!

376
00:17:41,735 --> 00:17:44,020
-麦克斯 卡洛琳 -闭嘴
- Max, Caroline-- - No.

377
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:45,440
你都不知道我要说什么呢
You don't even know what I was about to say.

378
00:17:45,520 --> 00:17:46,760
不管是什么 都给老娘闭嘴
Whatever it is, no.

379
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:47,900
我们有100万
We have $1 million.

380
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,440
是的 我们有100万
Yeah, we have $1 million.

381
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:52,460
没错 我们有100万 老娘不干了
Yeah, we have $1 million, and I quit!

382
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,320
老娘也不干了 小宝贝
And I quit too, baby!

383
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:56,940
我从上班第一天就恨这个破地方
I have hated this hellhole from day one.

384
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:58,800
再见[日文] 小矮子
Sayonara, short stuff!

385
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:02,920
我不知道哪个词更过分
I don't know what's more offensive.

386
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:04,440
是被当做"小日本" 还是"小矮子"
"Sayonara" or "short stuff"!

387
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:07,800
我觉得是"小日本"比较狠 小矮子
I would go with "Sayonara," short stuff.

388
00:18:14,040 --> 00:18:15,400
这脱衣速度比12岁的小毛孩
That got off quicker than

389
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:16,900
看见梅根·福克斯的"缴械"速度还快
a 12-year-old looking at Megan Fox.

390
00:18:18,170 --> 00:18:18,880
快吗
Quick?

391
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:21,120
三年以来 我一直梦想着脱掉这身制服
I've been trying to get out of this thing for three years.

392
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:23,860
拉链卡住了 这就像部恐怖片
This zipper is stuck! This is like a horror movie!

393
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,940
帮我 快帮我把这死玩意脱下来
Help me! Get this damn thing off me!

394
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:28,020
扯下来 剪烂 再一把火烧了它
Tear it off, cut it off, light it on fire!

395
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:28,900
但小心我的头发
Well, watch my hair.

396
00:18:28,980 --> 00:18:30,320
无所谓了 反正我有钱可以买新头发
Oh, who cares! I'll buy new hair!

397
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:32,680
靠 我从上面脱吧
Damn it, I'll just go over.

398
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,940
太棒了 我们解脱了
Yes! We're out of here.

399
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:36,840
再也不用想着餐馆和小蛋糕店了
No more diner, no more cupcakes.

400
00:18:37,380 --> 00:18:38,620
慢着 连小蛋糕店也不要了吗
Wait, wait, no more cupcakes?

401
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:40,680
你在说什么啊
What are you talking about?

402
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:42,720
我们可以用这笔钱扶植我们的事业
With all this money, we can grow our business.

403
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:45,180
我什么都不要扶植
Oh, I'm not growing anything

404
00:18:45,180 --> 00:18:47,840
除了我床头柜那株超级大麻
except a big-ass weed plant on my nightstand.

405
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,320
但那是我们的梦想
But it's our dream.

406
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:52,940
我不需要梦想 穷人才需要梦想活下去
I don't need a dream. Dreams are for poor people!

407
00:18:53,660 --> 00:18:54,560
老娘有100万
I have $1 million.

408
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:56,500
我不要去上烘焙学校了
I'm not going to pastry school,

409
00:18:56,620 --> 00:18:58,320
我甚至连厕所都不用去上了
I might not even go to the bathroom.

410
00:18:58,520 --> 00:19:00,880
我余生要死赖在床上不下来了
And I am definitely not getting out of bed.

411
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:02,840
我以后什么事都不用干
I will never do anything again!

412
00:19:05,340 --> 00:19:07,220
天啊 我以后什么事都不干了
Oh, my god, I'll never do anything again.

413
00:19:08,300 --> 00:19:09,220
我们不能辞职
We're not quitting.

414
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,680
我就知道
I knew it!

415
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:16,880
拜你和这拉链所赐 我永远也摆脱不掉这身制服
Between you and this zipper, I'll never get outta here.

416
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:20,580
我不行 你也听见我有100万后会变啥样
I can't. You heard what I'd be like with $1 million.

417
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:22,120
我肯定30岁就死了
I'd be dead at 30.

418
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:24,860
但这不是你一直以来的愿望吗
But isn't that what you've always wanted?

419
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:32,000
阿土伯 你在家吗
Hey, Uncle Pennybags, you home?

420
00:19:32,140 --> 00:19:33,500
我是说 你在垃圾箱吗
I mean, you dumpster?

421
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:37,080
我能进去吗
Hey, can I come in?

422
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:38,420
还是你已经放下了
Or did you already move on?

423
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:41,098
-如果是我也能理解 -没 进来吧
- 'cause I'd get it if you did. - Nah, come in.

424
00:19:41,098 --> 00:19:44,716
我无所事事 下下金蛋玩呢
Just sittin' in here fartin' diamonds.

425
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:48,080
我觉得我欠你一个道歉
Look, I think I owe you an apology.

426
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:51,220
之前我称你为"住在象牙垃圾殿里
You know how I called you a lazy mc-richy rich who never

427
00:19:51,220 --> 00:19:53,340
超级有钱一辈子无需为五斗米折腰的懒蛋"
had to work for anything and lives in an ivory dumpster?

428
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:56,280
这是道歉的一部分吗
Is this part of the apology

429
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:58,960
还是你在重述你伤我的心的过分句子
Or just the recap of mean things you've said to me?

430
00:19:59,940 --> 00:20:00,740
乖乖听着
Just listen.

431
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:04,060
我说得对 你的确无需为五斗米折腰
Well, I was right, you never did have to work for anything.

432
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:06,980
我开始怀疑你到底懂不懂什么是道歉了
Okay, I'm starting to think you don't know what an apology is.

433
00:20:08,340 --> 00:20:11,040
但即使你天生无需为五斗米折腰
But even though you never had to work for anything,

434
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:11,640
但你却付出努力
You do.

435
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:14,380
你真的有乖乖起床 好好上烘焙学校
You actually get up, you go to pastry school,

436
00:20:14,380 --> 00:20:16,660
还盖了一个垃圾箱房子 你努力做了很多事
and you build dumpsters, you do lots of stuff.

437
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,480
你还不知道我搞的慈善事业呢
Hey, you're not even familiar with my charity:

438
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:20,040
"为老人谋高潮"机构
Orgasms for old people.

439
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,680
这最好不是你开玩笑的
I hope you're not joking.

440
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:26,960
真相是 我不能忽略你的钱
Look, the truth is I couldn't see past your money.

441
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:28,320
但我只当你是个蓝精灵
All I saw was smurf.

442
00:20:29,140 --> 00:20:32,400
我之前认为女巫和蓝精灵不能在一起
And I thought witches and smurfs couldn't be together,

443
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:34,420
我错了
but I was wrong.

444
00:20:35,540 --> 00:20:36,260
没错
Yeah, you were.

445
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:40,460
麦克斯 你把钱要回来了吗
Max, did you get back the check yet?

446
00:20:40,460 --> 00:20:42,640
因为我刚找到另一位投资人
Because I just found a different investment guy.

447
00:20:42,660 --> 00:20:43,879
德国的合法投资人
A legit one in Germany.

448
00:20:43,879 --> 00:20:46,780
他名叫赫尔·斯路芬
His name is Herr Schluffen.

449
00:20:46,780 --> 00:20:49,681
抱歉 我现在就要把钱还回去
Well, I'm sorry. I'm giving it back right now.

450
00:20:49,681 --> 00:20:52,820
赫尔·斯路芬可以去死橹粪了
Herr Schluffen can schluff off.

451
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:54,620
等下 麦克斯 我能握一下这100万吗
Wait, Max, can I hold the million?

452
00:20:55,260 --> 00:20:58,080
一秒就好 让我重温上层中产阶级的感觉
For just one more second, I want to be upper-middle class.

453
00:21:02,540 --> 00:21:03,700
卡洛琳 把钱还回去
Caroline, give it back.
